  "description": "Example application demonstrating SAML2 Single Sign-On (SSO) implementation in ASP.NET Core using miniOrange's SAML2 package. This template provides a complete, working example with all necessary configurations and UI components.\n\n            ✅ Plug-and-play SAML SSO for ASP.NET Core  \n            ✅ Pre-configured for quick setup with miniOrange IdP  \n            ✅ Ideal for enterprise authentication and secure login  \n            ✅ Supports ASP.NET Core\n            ✅ Developer-friendly with customizable SAML configs  \n            ✅ Supports HTTPS, error logging, and multi-environment deployment  \n\n            Save time and reduce complexity with our trusted and secure SSO solution — used by thousands of organizations worldwide.\n\n            🔗 Learn more: https://www.miniorange.com/documentation",
